"This link seems to include a private access key (for example a token or signature). Anyone who scans the code can use it until it expires, so share it only with your own phone." = "Lo mxhumanisi ubonakala ufaka isixhumanisi sokufinyelela esifihlakele (umzekelo, i-token noma umbhalo ofingqiwe). Wonke umuntu obheka ikhowudi angayisebenzisa kuze kube sekuphele isikhathi sayo, ngakho-ke belana ngefoni yakho kuphela.";
