"Speed limits, connections per torrent, upload slots and seeding are set for each torrent when you add it, or later under Torrent Settings. Torrents use the proxy from the Connection tab (HTTP or SOCKS5, or the Mac's proxy with \"Use the system settings\") and the speed limit for all downloads. Changes apply to torrents started afterwards. Peers and trackers can see your IP address, or your proxy's." = "Izilimi zejubane, ukuxhumana kwe-torrent ngayinye, ukufaka ama-slots kanye nokutshala kumiswa ku-torrent ngayinye uma uyifaka, noma ngemuva ngaphansi kwe-Izilungiselelo ze-Torrent. Ama-torrents asebenzisa i-proxy kusuka ku-Connection tab (HTTP noma i-SOCKS5, noma i-Mac's proxy nge-\"Use the system settings\") kanye nelimi lejubane lokulayisha phansi konke. Ushintsho luyasebenza kuma-torrents aqala ngemuva kwalokho. Abalingani kanye nabalandeleli bangabona idilesi yakho ye-IP, noma i-proxy yakho.";
"Settings used for every download from a website. A site also covers its subdomains (example.com covers www.example.com). Logins are only sent to that site and are kept with the app's other secrets." = "Izilungiselelo ezisetshenziswa kuwo wonke ukukhuphuka kusuka kwiwebhusayithi. Iwebhusayithi ifaka nezindawo zayo ezingaphansi (isibonelo.com ifaka www.isibonelo.com). Ukungena kuthunyelwe kuphela kulo sayithi futhi kugcinwa nezinye izimfihlo zesicelo.";
"A backup holds your settings, site settings, queues and the downloads list. Passwords and cookies are never put in a backup." = "I-backup igcina izilungiselelo zakho, izilungiselelo zesitezi, amafolomu kanye nohlu lokulayisha ngezansi. Amaphasiwedi nama-cookies angeke afakwe kwi-backup.";
"When you copy a link that ends in one of these types, the Add window opens with it." = "Uma ukopa i-link ephelezelwa ngasinye salezi zinhlobo, i-Engeza ifasitela livula nalo.";
"Expected checksums are checked automatically when a download finishes. Queues can also quit the app, sleep or shut down the Mac when they are done (Scheduler)." = "Izibalo ezilindelekile zokuhlola zihlolwa ngokuzenzakalela uma kukhuphuka kuqediwe. Iziqephu zingayeka futhi uhlelo lokusebenza, ziphumule noma zivale i-Mac uma kwenziwe (Isicwangcisi).";
"Save the extension folder, open the browser's extensions page, switch on Developer mode, choose Load unpacked and pick the folder." = "Gcina ifolda yokudlulisa, vula ikhasi lokudlulisa lesiphequluli, shintsha indlela yomthuthukisi, khetha Layisha okungenasihlungi bese ukhetha ifolda.";
"Save the add-on file and drag it onto a Firefox window. Firefox installs add-ons that are signed; see the README for signing your copy." = "Gcina ifayela lokungeza bese ushaya kwifasitela le Firefox. I-Firefox ifaka ama-add-ons abhalwe ngezansi; bona i-README ukushicilela ikhophi yakho.";
"Install the ndm command, then for example: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night" = "Faka umlayezo we-ndm, bese ufaka, isibonelo: ndm https://example.com/file.zip --queue Night";
"Finding the qualities on offer…" = "Ukuthola izici ezinikezelwe…";
"Video sites are saved in the best quality available, with picture and sound joined." = "Amasayithi wevidiyo agcinwa ngekhwalithi engcono kakhulu etholakalayo, ngesithombe nesandi esihlobene.";
"Put a range in square brackets: [001-100] keeps three digits, [1-100] does not, [a-z] uses letters and [0-100:5] counts in fives. Several ranges multiply." = "Faka umkhawulo kuma-square brackets: [001-100] igcina ama-digits amathathu, [1-100] ayisebenzi, [a-z] isebenzisa ama-letters futhi [0-100:5] ibala ngama-fives. Ama-ranges amaningi aphindaphindwa.";
